1r3k|n|A red amorphous powder consisting of ferric oxide. It is used in polishing glass, metal, or gems, and as a cosmetic, etc. Called also crocus, jeweler's rouge, etc. ; A cosmetic used for giving a red color to the cheeks or lips. The best is prepared from the dried flowers of the safflower, but it is often made from carmine.	a:tu5,56,3~tu5,56,3	v:vct,47,1;v8y,27,3~v8y,27,3;vct,47,1	n:6k2,141,1;1i81,96,2;adp,87,2~1i81,96,2;adp,87,2;6k2,141,1
